=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward review-stop ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. tcp's Stop forwarding: hardn's file$
# deleted and rsyslog restarted. Nothing else is undone.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Stop forwarding ##############################################$
$
# Note$
# Logs stay on the host alone. rsyslog stays installed.$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Server               None$
$
   -  Delete hardn's forwarding file$
      /etc/rsyslog.d/60-hardn-forward.conf$
      @@ -1,4 +0,0 @@$
      -# Written by hardn (Log Forwarding).$
      -*.* action(type="omfwd" protocol="tcp"$
      -    target="192.0.2.50" port="514"$
      -    queue.type="linkedList")$
$
   -  Restart rsyslog$
      rsyslog$
      $ systemctl restart rsyslog$
$
  Stop forwarding logs? [y/N, 0 or q]: $
$
$

